{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_162_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_162","textTraditional":"一、十有三年。春，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_162_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_162","textTraditional":"二、夏，取詩。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_162_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_162","textTraditional":"詩者何？邾婁之邑也。曷為不繫乎邾婁？諱亟也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_162_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_162","textTraditional":"三、秋九月庚辰，楚子審卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_162_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_162","textTraditional":"四、冬，城防。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}